The RKLLM headers (rkllm.h, runtime 1.2.3 and 1.3.1) are published by Rockchip in
https://github.com/airockchip/rknn-llm and remain under their original terms.
They are not included in this repository: scripts/fetch-headers.sh downloads them
from the upstream release tags. The RKLLM runtime library (librkllmrt.so) must also
be obtained from that repository.
